From 83cc35d7fc69dcedd0974365534baab493deffeb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: caoanhhao <caoanhhao2@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 12:40:32 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] venus/android: accept linear tiling in AHB image format
 queries

ANGLE creates its Vulkan image for an AHardwareBuffer with
VK_IMAGE_TILING_LINEAR whenever the buffer has CPU read/write usage,
and fails eglCreateImageKHR(EGL_NATIVE_BUFFER_ANDROID) with
EGL_BAD_PARAMETER when vkGetPhysicalDeviceImageFormatProperties2
rejects that.  With SurfaceFlinger on ANGLE this aborts RenderEngine
("Unable to generate SkSurface") on its CPU-readable render targets,
e.g. the region sampling buffers.

Venus never creates the AHB image with the requested tiling: the
deferred create info is always switched to
VK_IMAGE_TILING_DRM_FORMAT_MODIFIER_EXT with the layout gralloc chose,
and gralloc allocates CPU-usage buffers linear.  So accept LINEAR as
well as OPTIMAL in the query.

caoanhhao used AI to code
---
 src/virtio/vulkan/vn_physical_device.c | 12 ++++++++----
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/virtio/vulkan/vn_physical_device.c b/src/virtio/vulkan/vn_physical_device.c
index fedab3f..04a9be5 100644
--- a/src/virtio/vulkan/vn_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/virtio/vulkan/vn_physical_device.c
@@ -2631,11 +2631,15 @@ vn_get_ahb_image_props(struct vn_physical_device *physical_dev,
                        const VkPhysicalDeviceImageFormatInfo2 *info,
                        VkImageFormatProperties2 *props)
 {
-   /* Only advertise support for optimal tiling since venus is unable to
-    * detiling if the AHB allocated outside is tiled. Internally venus always
-    * overrides the tiling to VK_IMAGE_TILING_DRM_FORMAT_MODIFIER_EXT.
+   /* Internally venus always overrides the tiling to
+    * VK_IMAGE_TILING_DRM_FORMAT_MODIFIER_EXT with the layout gralloc chose,
+    * so the requested tiling does not change the image.  Linear is accepted
+    * as well because ANGLE asks for it on every AHB with CPU usage, which
+    * gralloc allocates linear anyway (e.g. SurfaceFlinger's region sampling
+    * buffers); rejecting it makes eglCreateImageKHR fail.
     */
-   if (info->tiling != VK_IMAGE_TILING_OPTIMAL)
+   if (info->tiling != VK_IMAGE_TILING_OPTIMAL &&
+       info->tiling != VK_IMAGE_TILING_LINEAR)
       return VK_ERROR_FORMAT_NOT_SUPPORTED;
 
    /* No need to support AHB + VK_EXT_separate_stencil_usage. */
